85:- [ ] T004 Save the six tools (`scratch/tools/convert_hints.py`, `replace_block.py`, `mutate.py`, `apply_edits.py`, `suite_compare.py`, `strict-census.mjs`). Run the six blocks below, each exactly as written. Verify: the check block after them prints five `PY_OK` lines and then `NODE_OK`.
